{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>City God Alice</strong> <br>Set within the ancient mountain shrine of <strong>Jiantan Mountain City</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Scroll down to the bottom of the controls guide)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Lin Chengdong, who as a child signed a mysterious pact with the City God. Bound by this contract, he is fated to die at the age of twenty and to serve under the deity\u2019s command. Yet in his final year of life, Alice\u2014the acting City God\u2014appears before him, inviting him on a journey to uncover the hidden truth behind his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices across vast branching storylines will decide not only Lin Chengdong\u2019s life or death, but also the rise and fall of the city under the City God\u2019s protection\u2014and how much of a century-old tale of spirits you can uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore eerie, side-scrolling environments filled with supernatural events and psychological disturbances.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/972680cb4f2337260faf3c271f1f17f4.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/7ecbfc8dfcb7e4fdcbb50f1a437dbb41.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in turn-based battles where tactical positioning intertwines with sanity management.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/ad2403069fcaa323add2839e848fc366.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1551 height=769 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/33c170e8e3bdfde5b56a916d5eab9dbb.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1538 height=806 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond combat, manage the daily life of the City God\u2019s temple: allocate resources, build reputation, face random events, and deepen bonds with spirit allies. Experience the life of a temple keeper who turns forbidden taboos into everyday routine.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/ccdfc78b1a081eb8e9b1e98a278a8ce4.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CityGod Alice</strong> is more than just a horror mystery. It is a game crafted for players who seek both profound storytelling and rich gameplay.<br>We look forward to welcoming you on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic Gameplay &amp; Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>City God Alice</i> currently supports keyboard and mouse only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flat view movement: W/S/A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling movement: A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open inventory: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign weapons/items to shortcut: Left mouse drag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close text interface: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use quick items: Number keys 1\u20136</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue dialogue: Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle &amp; Main City Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All actions can be performed via mouse clicks on panels or buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick items during battle: Number keys 1\u20136</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warehouse Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHIFT + Click: Select resources in multiples</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB: Switch between resource details of items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045810?t=1762845323","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/7527ed174e67ac95719184794724a1c2652c3f07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762845323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/a31298583269f8e943b5385c7fa83da2278791e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762845323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/a31298583269f8e943b5385c7fa83da2278791e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762845323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>City God Alice</strong> <br>Set within the ancient mountain shrine of <strong>Jiantan Mountain City</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Scroll down to the bottom of the controls guide)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Lin Chengdong, who as a child signed a mysterious pact with the City God. Bound by this contract, he is fated to die at the age of twenty and to serve under the deity\u2019s command. Yet in his final year of life, Alice\u2014the acting City God\u2014appears before him, inviting him on a journey to uncover the hidden truth behind his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices across vast branching storylines will decide not only Lin Chengdong\u2019s life or death, but also the rise and fall of the city under the City God\u2019s protection\u2014and how much of a century-old tale of spirits you can uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore eerie, side-scrolling environments filled with supernatural events and psychological disturbances.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/972680cb4f2337260faf3c271f1f17f4.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/7ecbfc8dfcb7e4fdcbb50f1a437dbb41.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in turn-based battles where tactical positioning intertwines with sanity management.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/ad2403069fcaa323add2839e848fc366.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1551 height=769 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/33c170e8e3bdfde5b56a916d5eab9dbb.avif?t=1762845323\" width=1538 height=806 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond combat, manage the daily life of the City God\u2019s temple: allocate resources, build reputation, face random events, and deepen bonds with spirit allies. Experience the life of a temple keeper who turns forbidden taboos into everyday routine.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: